<v Ira Glass>[资金支持鸣谢]

00:58:22.490 --> 00:58:28.740
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who walks up to me at the end of every single show we do and declares--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ的管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚负责，他每期节目结束时都会走到我身边宣布——

00:58:28.740 --> 00:58:39.440
<v Woman 1>It was an amazing experience. I actually still feel quite out of my body. Really.
<v Woman 1>那是一次令人惊叹的体验。我实际上仍然感到我的灵魂脱离了肉体。真的。

00:58:39.440 --> 00:58:44.230
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Happy Independence Day. Back next week with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。独立日快乐。下周同一时间继续带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:58:44.230 --> 00:58:56.320
<v Woman 1>And thank you for creating the space to help me let go. I'm just feeling incredibly emotional.
<v Woman 1>感谢你创造了这个空间来帮助我释放。我感到无比激动。

